   "text": "BJ has lived in an aged care home for the past 8 years and has seen huge improvements since the introduction of the Aged Care Act.\n\"A lot has improved since the Act. We are listened to. I get the care and attention here. Aged care is somewhere you go to live, and to live the best life.\"\nWhen older people are heard, their concerns are addressed and they are involved in decisions about their care, o",
