   "textLength": 363,
   "text": "At 96 years old, Jim, lives in an aged care home and finds it \"a beautiful place to live.\"\n\"There’s always something to do, if you want to, so you’ve got loads of choices to make.\"\nAged care in Australia is designed to put older people at the centre of their care, helping them understand their options, make informed choices and have their preferences respected.",
